{
    "title": "Notepad, Notes, Easy Notebook",
    "description": "Want an <b>easy-to-use notepad</b> for quick note-taking? \r\nWant a <b>handy memo pad</b> to make <b>to do lists, shopping lists</b> with reminders?\r\nThis free note taking app, notebook, and memo pad app meets all your needs! <b>No ads!</b>\r\n\r\nNotein - Notepad, Notes, Lists is an awesome notes app for android. You can write notes with colorful backgrounds for easy notes management. <b>Sticky notes widgets</b>, note reminders, note lock, etc., all make note-taking so simple, quick, and safe. Take notes just like using pen and paper.\r\n\r\n\u270d\ufe0f<b>Handy Note Taking App</b>\r\nNotein, the free notepad app provides two note-taking modes, text mode (lined paper style), and checklist mode. Notein will <b>automatically save notes</b> as you type. \r\n- Take <b>quick notes, school notes, meeting notes</b>, anytime, anywhere.\r\n- Write <b>memos, to do lists, shopping lists, tasks, etc.</b> to better organize your life.\r\nCheck off, archive, edit, delete, share notes easily with this good notes app. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcc5<b>Calendar Notes and Memos</b>\r\nAwsome note pad app allows you to <b>add notes to the calendar</b>! Use Notein to create notes, tasks, to-do lists on the calendar. View and organize your notes in the calendar mode makes it easy to master your schedule!\r\n\r\n\u23f0<b>Reminders for Notes and To-do Lists</b>\r\nYou can <b>set reminders</b> for your notes. Free note pad app Notein will remind you on time and never let you miss any important thing! \r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8<b>Manage Notes by Color</b>\r\nGood notes app Notein supports color notes. Write notes with different colors to easily organize your notes and lists. Sorting and filtering notes by color will help find your target faster. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd10<b>Notes with Password</b>\r\nWant to keep your notes private? No problem! Free notepad app allows you to set passwords to protect your notes. Notepad app free with locker keeps your notes safe!\r\n\r\n\u2728<b>Sticky Notes Widgets on Home Screen</b>\r\nNotein - Notepad, Notes, Lists supports adding sticky notes widgets to your home screen. Access your notes quickly from the notes widgets.\r\n\r\n\u2601\ufe0f<b>Backup and Restore</b>\r\nThis notebook app supports backing up all your notes and lists to the Cloud. Never worry about losing your notes. \r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\n- Powerful notepad/notebook/memo pad for note taking \r\n- Write various notes, class notes, book notes, sticky notes, text notes \r\n- <b>Pin important notes</b> and view through notes widgets\r\n- Calendar mode to better schedule your time, manage your notes\r\n- Share notes with friends via Twitter, SMS, Wechat, Email, etc.\r\n- <b>Make color notes</b>, manage notes by color\r\n- Display notes in list/grid/details mode\r\n- Sort notes by time and color, quickly find notes\r\n- <b>Get things done</b> (GTD)\r\n- Notification bar reminder\r\n- Small size notepad app\r\n\r\nTry Notein - Notepad, Notes, Lists for an excellent note editing experience!\r\n\r\nYour feedback and suggestions are always welcome! If you have any suggestions or questions, please feel free to contact us at noteinfeedback@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Want an <b>easy-to-use notepad</b> for quick note-taking? <br>Want a <b>handy memo pad</b> to make <b>to do lists, shopping lists</b> with reminders?<br>This free note taking app, notebook, and memo pad app meets all your needs! <b>No ads!</b><br><br>Notein - Notepad, Notes, Lists is an awesome notes app for android. You can write notes with colorful backgrounds for easy notes management. <b>Sticky notes widgets</b>, note reminders, note lock, etc., all make note-taking so simple, quick, and safe. Take notes just like using pen and paper.<br><br>\u270d\ufe0f<b>Handy Note Taking App</b><br>Notein, the free notepad app provides two note-taking modes, text mode (lined paper style), and checklist mode. Notein will <b>automatically save notes</b> as you type. <br>- Take <b>quick notes, school notes, meeting notes</b>, anytime, anywhere.<br>- Write <b>memos, to do lists, shopping lists, tasks, etc.</b> to better organize your life.<br>Check off, archive, edit, delete, share notes easily with this good notes app. <br><br>\ud83d\udcc5<b>Calendar Notes and Memos</b><br>Awsome note pad app allows you to <b>add notes to the calendar</b>! Use Notein to create notes, tasks, to-do lists on the calendar. View and organize your notes in the calendar mode makes it easy to master your schedule!<br><br>\u23f0<b>Reminders for Notes and To-do Lists</b><br>You can <b>set reminders</b> for your notes. Free note pad app Notein will remind you on time and never let you miss any important thing! <br><br>\ud83c\udfa8<b>Manage Notes by Color</b><br>Good notes app Notein supports color notes. Write notes with different colors to easily organize your notes and lists. Sorting and filtering notes by color will help find your target faster. <br><br>\ud83d\udd10<b>Notes with Password</b><br>Want to keep your notes private? No problem! Free notepad app allows you to set passwords to protect your notes. Notepad app free with locker keeps your notes safe!<br><br>\u2728<b>Sticky Notes Widgets on Home Screen</b><br>Notein - Notepad, Notes, Lists supports adding sticky notes widgets to your home screen. Access your notes quickly from the notes widgets.<br><br>\u2601\ufe0f<b>Backup and Restore</b><br>This notebook app supports backing up all your notes and lists to the Cloud. Never worry about losing your notes. <br><br>FEATURES<br><br>- Powerful notepad/notebook/memo pad for note taking <br>- Write various notes, class notes, book notes, sticky notes, text notes <br>- <b>Pin important notes</b> and view through notes widgets<br>- Calendar mode to better schedule your time, manage your notes<br>- Share notes with friends via Twitter, SMS, Wechat, Email, etc.<br>- <b>Make color notes</b>, manage notes by color<br>- Display notes in list/grid/details mode<br>- Sort notes by time and color, quickly find notes<br>- <b>Get things done</b> (GTD)<br>- Notification bar reminder<br>- Small size notepad app<br><br>Try Notein - Notepad, Notes, Lists for an excellent note editing experience!<br><br>Your feedback and suggestions are always welcome! If you have any suggestions or questions, please feel free to contact us at noteinfeedback@gmail.com.",
